{"type":"Film","id":"FR2014_075","slug":"fr2014-075-libre-et-assoupi","title":{"native":"Libre et assoupi","english":"Nice and Easy"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2014-05-07","year":2014},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Benjamin Guedj","slug":"benjamin-guedj","name":"Benjamin Guedj","birthYear":1975,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/98/209/119138/format_page/libre-et-assoupi.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIYVQDMZR-Y"},"synopsis":{"native":"Sébastien n’a qu’une ambition dans la vie : ne rien faire. Son horizon, c’est son canapé. Sa vie il ne veut pas la vivre mais la contempler. Mais aujourd’hui, si tu ne fais rien... Tu n’es rien. Alors poussé par ses deux colocs, qui enchainent stages et petits boulots, la décidée Anna et le pas tout à fait décidé Bruno, Sébastien va devoir faire ... Un peu.","english":"Sébastien has only one ambition in life: to do nothing. His couch is his horizon. He doesn't want to live his life, he just wants to contemplate it. But, these days, if you don't do anything, you amount to nothing. Encouraged by his two roommates, determined Anna and vacillating Bruno, who go from internship to odd job, Sébastien must do... A little of something."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Benjamin Guedj","slug":"benjamin-guedj","name":"Benjamin Guedj","birthYear":1975,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Director of the film"},{"person":{"id":"Bernard Ménez","slug":"bernard-menez","name":"Bernard Ménez","birthYear":1944,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Jean-Michel Lahmi","slug":"jean-michel-lahmi","name":"Jean-Michel Lahmi","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identi